# Using & Developing AI Agents in DBS Finance
## A Practical Guide for the Finance Department

---

## 1. Introduction & Purpose

AI is moving fast, and Finance is expected to keep pace — not just as a consumer of AI tools, but as an active builder of AI-assisted workflows. This guide exists to give Finance teams a shared foundation: what tools are available, how to think about using them, and what guardrails matter before something goes into production.

This guide covers the AI surfaces available to DBS Finance today and in the near term, and provides practical guidance on how to use and develop agents and skills responsibly. It is intended for both business users who want to automate workflows and technical leads who are building or evaluating AI capabilities.

This is a living document. As the AI landscape at DBS evolves — particularly with the upcoming availability of Claude Code and Claude Cowork — this guide will be updated accordingly.

